  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">UNDP-NGI Landslide Risk Management in Cox&#x2019;s Bazar</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Project proposed action will enhance resilience of Rohingya refugees and host-communities through improving localized landslide early warning and dissemination system, strengthening capacity of local government, humanitarian and first response agencies and implementing community-led nature-based solutions for landslide risk mitigation in underserved communities. The project will enhance functional and technical capacities of disaster management committees and DRM institutions of landslide affected areas, so that they can better plan, manage and respond to landslide disaster.</narrative>
  </description>
